    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">It is beautiful to look at, hard to reach, and terribly difficult to climb. Winds of 200 kilometres per hour and more scream across it day and night, while the temperature falls to -20C or lower. Every year, some who try to climb the highest mountian in the world do not return. But for a century people have been coming to climb Everest - some alone, some in groups, but all with a dream of going to the highest place in teh world. This is their story</marc:subfield>
